# Graphify runtime and official leaf policy.
# Root graphify-out payloads remain runtime ignored by default.
# Reconstructible leaves under graphify-out/leaf_slices/<leaf>/ are allowed
# in Git only when their BUILD_MANIFEST.md declares scope, corpus, provenance
# and clean diagnostics.
graphify-out/*
**/graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/leaf_slices/
!**/graphify-out/leaf_slices/
graphify-out/leaf_slices/*
**/graphify-out/leaf_slices/*
!graphify-out/leaf_slices/*/
!graphify-out/leaf_slices/*/**
!**/graphify-out/leaf_slices/*/
